Crown was added as a [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Generated_Cards Generated] card for C-Round in '''Beta 30.0'''. It would turn an ally C-Round into a K-Round, but did nothing beyond that. '''Beta 31.0''' fixed that letting you draw a card if there's no ally C-Round.

'''Beta 41.0''' buffed it quite a bit. Not only will it now let you draw a card at any time, using it on anything but C-Round will give the targeted monster +1/+2 (even a K-Round). Keep in mind that it can now target enemy monsters.

=== Stats ===
Creator: C-Round

Cost: 2

Effects:
* Turn an ally C-Round into K-Round. (Post Beta 30.0)
** If there's none, draw a card. (Post Beta 31.0)
* Give a monster +1/+2. Turn a C-Round into a K-Round instead. Draw a card. (Post Beta 41.0, Current)
Rarity Creator: Purple (Epic)
